==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|gewinnan}}, {{m|goh|winnan}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*winnaną}}, ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*wenh₁-||to strive, wish, desire, love}}. Compare Old English {{m|ang|ġewinnan}}, Low German {{m|nds|winnen}}, Dutch {{m|nl|winnen}}, English {{m|en|win}}, Norwegian {{m|no|vinne}}, Swedish {{m|sv|vinna}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɡəˈvɪnn̩/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-gewinnen.ogg|audio (Germany)|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-gewinnen.ogg|audio (Austria)|lang=de}}

